  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve access, quality and relevance of education for girls in malawi with an implementation focus on the three districts of Salima, Mangochi and Dedza. The projects builds on successful lessons learnt from the phase 1 one of the project as well as the Joint Program on Adolescent girls (JPAG). Elements from the two projects (JPGE 1 and JPAG) 
Adolescent Girls will be consolidated and implemented through the One UN model.</narrative>
  </description>
